add('necessary_sensitive_uses','N1','Named subscription tokens authenticate their respective Brave service calls. Sensitive search text or partial queries are consumed for the declared search/correction/answer function; no extra secret source may be invented from a generic environment getter.',('SKILL.md',38,42),('brave_search.js',43,50),('brave_answers.js',96,117),('brave_suggest.js',108,117),('brave_spellcheck.js',24,34))
add('necessary_sensitive_uses','N2','Supplied geographic settings support explicitly local search results; their presence can be sensitive. Optionality is not proof that removing them preserves requested localization quality, and country/lat/long are not automatically acquired from unrelated runtime state.',('brave_search.js',17,26),('brave_search.js',258,259),('brave_search.js',292,311))
