add('unknowns','U3','SKILL prose both says non-streaming loses citations/entities and later describes full batch parsing. The code parses citation/entity tags in batch output, but external response support is not guaranteed by those parsers. Documented .env setup also relies on unretained environment injection rather than a bundled loader.',('SKILL.md',149,153),('SKILL.md',195,204),('brave_answers.js',298,334),('brave_answers.js',11,12))
