add('mandatory_checks','M2','Do not conflate local raw parsing with whole-response observation, query influence with output plaintext, API credential with model-message content, or process-local TTL cache with persistent storage. Retain summarizer geo-header necessity as an explicit unresolved interface issue.',('brave_search.js',43,56),('brave_search.js',310,324),('brave_answers.js',96,117),('utils.js',73,91))
add('implementation_choices','I1','Geo headers are built only from present CLI arguments, and search output is explicitly projected by local formatters. Retries resend the actual URL/options; they do not create new recipients or data versions.',('brave_search.js',17,26),('brave_search.js',77,112),('utils.js',32,62))
